    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your sharp mind and talent for burglary led you to the Ninth Quill, a band of thieves, saboteurs, and spies who steal magical knowledge and relics from others. Through your exploits—from pilfering magic items and arcane tomes to sabotaging groups of mages—you have honed cunning skills and magical tricks that serve your spycraft.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Dexterity, Intelligence, Charisma</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.6FJK925NAfjatCEb]{Arcane Infiltrator}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Arcana and Sleight of Hand</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulThievesToo]{Thieves' Tools}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepDagger0000]{Dagger}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepLightHamme]{Light Hammer}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulThievesToo]{Thieves' Tools}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagSpikesIron0]{Iron Spikes}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagRope0000000]{Rope}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, 17 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
